==Description==
The '''CandyCorn Nametag''' is a nametag that could be obtained at Level 30 of the premium [[Hexscape Event#Hexscape Event Battle Pass|Hexscape Event Battle Pass]] track. At that Level, it costed {{CandyCorns|1,020 Candy Corns}} or {{Robux|90}} ({{Robux|67}} for the Black Friday 2024 Sale) to unlock it, with a total cost of {{CandyCorns|14,510 Candy Corns}} or {{Robux|2,430}} ({{Robux|1,825}} for the Black Friday 2024 Sale).

The '''CandyCorn Nametag''' has text which has three colors, white at the top, yellow in the middle and orange at the bottom. The text has a translucent dark orange outline. Multiple candy corns appear behind it, which fall down and decrease in size.

